    {
      "id": "REdNLZXfAhXjq5wFsslpz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 159.428879790802,
      "y": 462.5658290871326,
      "width": 360.79949951171875,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2114388003,
      "version": 137,
      "versionNonce": 939649987,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792493889111,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Hash (bull:<queue>:<jobId>)\n    * Selalu dibuat saat add().\n    * Menyimpan semua data job.\n    * Tidak pernah dihapus \n      sampai job di-remove baik\n      removeOnComplete atau removeOnFail.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Hash (bull:<queue>:<jobId>)\n    * Selalu dibuat saat add().\n    * Menyimpan semua data job.\n    * Tidak pernah dihapus \n      sampai job di-remove baik\n      removeOnComplete atau removeOnFail.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EaobCVuNLtwDCK8Mq2xEV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 159.428879790802,
      "y": 637.4230722163179,
      "width": 510.3992919921875,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1024534083,
      "version": 377,
      "versionNonce": 552958819,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792493889111,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. List wait\n    * Job tanpa priority (priority = 0) dan tidak delayed.\n    * FIFO (default) atau LIFO (lifo: true).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. List wait\n    * Job tanpa priority (priority = 0) dan tidak delayed.\n    * FIFO (default) atau LIFO (lifo: true).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pEe0EAPO2kcmFrzU8jodg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 159.428879790802,
      "y": 752.2803153455031,
      "width": 448.79937744140625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1090851,
      "version": 414,
      "versionNonce": 806754051,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792493889111,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. ZSET prioritized\n    * Job yang punya priority > 0.\n    * Score = kombinasi priority + counter \n      (supaya job dengan priority sama tetap FIFO).\n    * Lower number = higher priority.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. ZSET prioritized\n    * Job yang punya priority > 0.\n    * Score = kombinasi priority + counter \n      (supaya job dengan priority sama tetap FIFO).\n    * Lower number = higher priority.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DxN_Zz3QAC4BVG6rJxPjL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 821.7149951646866,
      "y": 462.5658290871326,
      "width": 431.19940185546875,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1557302307,
      "version": 364,
      "versionNonce": 870465187,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792493889111,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. ZSET delayed\n    * Job yang punya delay.\n    * Score = timestamp kapan job boleh diproses.\n    * Worker secara periodik",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. ZSET delayed\n    * Job yang punya delay.\n    * Score = timestamp kapan job boleh diproses.\n    * Worker secara periodik",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Sv4_aZRR8iNwxblRiwSbh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 821.7149951646866,
      "y": 617.4230722163179,
      "width": 466.39935302734375,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1991834627,
      "version": 403,
      "versionNonce": 654864963,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792493889111,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. List active\n    * Job yang sedang dikerjakan worker.\n    * Dipindah secara atomic dari wait / prioritized.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. List active\n    * Job yang sedang dikerjakan worker.\n    * Dipindah secara atomic dari wait / prioritized.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RnMM9JrUf26U9I31x0hbo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 821.7149951646866,
      "y": 752.2803153455031,
      "width": 510.3992919921875,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
